msgstr "Ħiliet oħra"

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:763
#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:770
#, draft
msgid "Skills"
msgstr "Ħiliet"

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/candidate.py:583
#, python-format, draft
msgid ""
"Some sections of the file have nowhere to go in Postulo yet and were not read: %(sections)s."
msgstr ""
"Xi sezzjonijiet tal-fajl m'għandhomx fejn imorru f'Postulo għadu u ma nqrawx: %(sections)s."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:653
#, draft
msgid "That does not look like a Europass file: it has no LearnerInfo section."
msgstr "Dan ma jidhirx bħal fajl tal-Europass: m'għandux taqsima LearnerInfo."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:637
#, python-format, draft
msgid "That file is not readable JSON: %(reason)s"
msgstr "Dan il-fajl mhuwiex JSON li jinqara: %(reason)s"

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:344
#, python-format, draft
msgid "That file is not readable XML: %(reason)s"
msgstr "Dan il-fajl mhuwiex XML li jinqara: %(reason)s"

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:634
#, draft
msgid "That file is not UTF-8, so it is not a Europass export."
msgstr "Dan il-fajl mhuwiex UTF-8, għalhekk mhuwiex esportazzjoni tal-Europass."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:642
#, python-format, draft
msgid "That file nests more than %(limit)s levels deep, so it was not read."
msgstr ""
"Dan il-fajl huwa mdaħħal aktar fil-fond minn %(limit)s livelli, għalhekk ma nqarax."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:181
#, draft
msgid ""
"That is not a Europass file. Postulo reads the PDF europass.europa.eu gives you, the XML attached to it, and the older Europass XML and JSON; this is none of them."
msgstr ""
"Dak mhuwiex fajl Europass. Postulo jaqra l-PDF li jagħtik europass.europa.eu, l-XML imwaħħal miegħu, u l-Europass XML u JSON eqdem; dan mhuwiex ebda wieħed minnhom."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:240
#, draft
msgid ""
"That PDF has files attached to it, and none of them is a Europass CV. Upload the PDF europass.europa.eu gives you, as it is."
msgstr ""
"Dak il-PDF għandu fajls imwaħħlin miegħu, u l-ebda wieħed minnhom mhuwiex CV Europass. Ikkarga l-PDF li jagħtik europass.europa.eu, kif inhu."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:230
#, draft
msgid ""
"That PDF has nothing attached to it, so there is no Europass CV inside it to read. The PDF europass.europa.eu gives you carries the CV as an attached file, and a PDF printed or saved again by another program loses it: download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr ""
"Dak il-PDF m'għandu xejn imwaħħal miegħu, għalhekk m'hemm l-ebda CV Europass ġewwa fih x'jinqara. Il-PDF li jagħtik europass.europa.eu iġorr is-CV bħala fajl imwaħħal, u PDF stampat jew maħżun mill-ġdid minn programm ieħor jitlefu: niżżel is-CV mill-ġdid minn europass.europa.eu u ikkarga dak il-fajl kif inhu."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:194
#, draft
msgid ""
"That PDF is encrypted, so the Europass CV attached to it cannot be read. Download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr ""
"Dak il-PDF huwa kriptat, għalhekk is-CV Europass imwaħħal miegħu ma jistax jinqara. Niżżel is-CV mill-ġdid minn europass.europa.eu u ikkarga dak il-fajl kif inhu."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:358
#, draft
msgid ""
"That XML is not a Europass CV. Postulo reads the XML europass.europa.eu writes (a Candidate) and that of the Europass editor before it (a SkillsPassport); this is neither."
msgstr ""
"Dak l-XML mhuwiex CV Europass. Postulo jaqra l-XML li jikteb europass.europa.eu (Candidate) u dak tal-editur Europass ta' qablu (SkillsPassport); dan mhuwiex wieħed minnhom."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/__init__.py:40
#, draft
msgid ""
"The European CV format: the PDF europass.europa.eu gives you and the XML attached to it, and the older XML and JSON of the Europass service before it."
msgstr ""
"Il-format Ewropew tas-CV: il-PDF li jagħtik europass.europa.eu u l-XML imwaħħal miegħu, u l-XML u l-JSON eqdem tas-servizz Europass ta' qablu."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:203
#, draft
msgid ""
"The file attached to that PDF is damaged and could not be unpacked. Download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr ""
"Il-fajl imwaħħal ma' dak il-PDF huwa bil-ħsara u ma setax jinfetaħ. Niżżel is-CV mill-ġdid minn europass.europa.eu u ikkarga dak il-fajl kif inhu."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:198
#, python-format, draft
msgid ""
"The file attached to that PDF is packed in a way Postulo does not read (%(filter)s). Download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr ""
"Il-fajl imwaħħal ma' dak il-PDF huwa ppakkjat b'mod li Postulo ma jaqrax (%(filter)s). Niżżel is-CV mill-ġdid minn europass.europa.eu u ikkarga dak il-fajl kif inhu."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:207
#, python-format, draft
msgid ""
"The file attached to that PDF unpacks to more than %(limit)s MB, so it was not read."
msgstr ""
"Il-fajl imwaħħal ma' dak il-PDF jinfetaħ għal iktar minn %(limit)s MB, għalhekk ma nqarax."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/candidate.py:188
#, draft
msgid ""
"The file holds this career in more than one language, and only the first was read."
msgstr ""
"Il-fajl iżomm din il-karriera f'iktar minn lingwa waħda, u biss l-ewwel waħda nqrat."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:446
#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:716
#, draft
msgid "Work experience"
msgstr "Esperjenza tax-xogħol"
